[I] Multichannel parametric equaliser for JACK

[T] Zita-eq1 is a multichannel equaliser for JACK supporting up to 64
[T] channels, with a third order highpass filter, low and high frequency
[T] shelf sections and three parametric sections.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

[A] Kokkini Zita
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 0.3.4

[D] c37ec6cde5b47539e5aa3dc3c8a0868af54856653c660e2052655dfc zita-eq1-0.3.4.tar.bz2 https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/downloads/

srcdir=*/source
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -I$root$includedir/freetype2
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -c?:-L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libxft)
